Files: firmware/measat_releaseX1.8.hex firmware/82357a_fw.hex
Copyright: Agilent Technologies / Keysight Technologies
License: Agilent-firmware-redistributable
Comment:
 These firmware images are compiled into the ugpibd binary (via include_bytes!)
 and are therefore present in this package. They are redistributed unmodified
 from https://github.com/fmhess/linux_gpib_firmware, which obtained them from
 Agilent/Keysight.
 .
 The adapters require the firmware to be uploaded on every attach; ugpibd does
 this itself, which is why the images are embedded rather than optional.

License: Agilent-firmware-redistributable
 The firmware itself is proprietary. Its redistribution is permitted as part of
 drivers that operate the hardware. See the upstream repository's README files
 for the full redistribution context.
 .
 This firmware is not DFSG-free. A package intended for the Debian archive
 rather than direct distribution would need to live in non-free, or split the
 firmware into a separate non-free package.

